+            whitespace) and postcode. Under the version-2 identity it is the first 12 hex characters
+            of SHA-256 over 'V2|normalizedLastName|postcode', so owners sharing a last name and
+            postcode share it automatically, regardless of registration order.
+          type: string
+          readOnly: true
+          example: 'A1B2C3D4E5F6'
+        identityKey:
+          title: Identity key
